</h2>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1c09aa7 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="1c09aa7" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Broken garage door spring repair/replacement should be expected every few years in Arcadia due to garage door springs having a limited lifespan. Designed to last 10,000 cycles, with one cycle being completed every time you open and close your door, you can anticipate needing this repair every 5 to 7 years depending on your usage.</p><p>Broken garage door springs should never be adjusted, repaired or replaced by anyone other than a professional garage door repair technician. Continuing to operate your door with a broken spring is extremely dangerous. For your safety, halt any further use immediately, and contact the professionals at <a href="tel:(602) 335-1077">(602) 335-1077</a>.</p>								</div>
